      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Etheria teeters on the edge of war, and Catra knows Prime is pulling the strings. He's plotting her downfall even as he parades her as his heir. To survive, she forges a fragile alliance with Adora, the enemy she should hate most.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
